- **`provideSessionId`**: Annotated `@InternalAPI`, it takes an `ApplicationCall` and returns the result of `_sessionIdProvider(call)`.

The main structural difference: `CookieIdSessionBuilder` extends `CookieSessionBuilder`, while `HeaderIdSessionBuilder` extends `HeaderSessionBuilder`. The identity/provider logic is otherwise identical between them.

